# Security Rules

- Never log PII or secrets. Mask phone/email in logs and analytics.
- **No secrets in code or VCS**. Use environment variables and secret manager.
- Add `helmet`, strict CORS, rate limiting. Consider IP allowlist/MFA for admin areas (PRO).
- Sanitize uploads; validate MIME and size; store files in object storage with presigned URLs.
